riodic clocks. This declares conditions without reading actual squad counts or certifying a team-wide application.", "section69_input_scope": "Explicit cooperative/fragile QCheckBox bool states preserve existing physical component math and rank4 declaration across empty/positive observations. E0 S1 ignores the global cooperative flag and offers no S3. API text rejection, native placement, synchronized events and overlap identity remain separate.", "section70_actual_checkbox_screenshot": "wine-sown-tile-control-070.png", "section70_input_scope": "Actual checkbox label declares the existence of a ground enemy on a sown tile, not the selected target location. Genuine bool states retain original skill parameters/empty boundaries and four-sui unknown clock. No ground_type filter, position detection, actual coverage, trigger or teleport clock is inferred; S1/S2 omit this inactive key.", "supplemental_sections_66_70": [66, 67, 68, 69, 70], "supplemental_checks_by_section_66_70": {"66": 120, "67": 74, "68": 72, "69": 36, "70": 80}, "supplemental_checks_66_70": 382, "section70_final_checks_pending": false, "manual_token_attribute_scope": "Public API inputs have related regression coverage; actual UI has no manual all_units effects control", "deferred_probes": [], "resolved_problem": {"problem": "friendly scope report explanation was deferred after three historical attempts", "independent_diagnosis_source": "Z:\\workspace\\rougezhushou\\research\\p2-friendly-scope-report\\independent-diagnosis.json", "independent_diagnosis_sha256": "e902e74b0dbf2d405a256228eeb5a6140f700c6251faeafd8c66e0b01dd6e173", "historical_evidence_preserved": "verification/full-045/wine-ui.json; original three failed attempts remain unchanged", "prior_tmp_diagnosis": "/tmp/p2-draft50/independent-diagnosis.json unavailable after machine restart; reconstructed from persistent historical receipt", "recovery": "Both actual report modes now assert the explicit friendly acquisition clock remains unknown", "cur